<td valign="middle" class="whs8">
<p class="normal-table"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Output</b></span> pane is one of the three panes located in the left hand side of the KUBE ’s window.</p>
<p class="normal-table">All these panes are overlapped and you can switch between them by clicking on their tabs (which are in the lower left hand side) or by shortcuts:</p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-P-Cnormal-table">
<p class="normal-table"><span class="Shortcut">Ctrl + 1</span> for <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Scan</b></span> pane</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-P-Cnormal-table">
<p class="normal-table"><span class="Shortcut">Ctrl + 2</span> for <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Entities</b></span> pane</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-P-Cnormal-table">
<p class="normal-table"><span class="Shortcut">Ctrl + 3</span> for <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Output</b></span> pane</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="normal-table">The <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Output</b></span> pane records results of different functions applied to the data sets.</p>
<p class="normal-table">You can copy the information and paste it in any text editor.</p>
</td>
